{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#card-zh","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 RoboCasa 厨房机器人仿真插件。它通过 DSH 工具连接常驻 Python 仿真进程，并提供控制面板和实时预览。主要能力包括打开与观察场景、查询物体和夹具几何、移动机械臂、规划避障路径以及抓取和投放物体；还可检查状态、重置或恢复场景。适合希望用对话实验机器人操作或重复仿真任务的用户。需要本机准备可导入 robocasa 与 robosuite 的 Python 环境；插件会在本地保存设置、运行记录和截图。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:848-855","index.js:992-1025","worker.py:901-988","worker.py:1076-1126","index.js:706-748"]}
{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#card-en","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"robocasa-control brings RoboCasa kitchen simulations to DSH. Tools open scenes, locate objects, move the arm with motion planning, and grasp or drop items. A web panel shows controls and status. Local Python with RoboCasa and robosuite is required; settings and run records stay on the machine.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:848-855","index.js:992-1025","worker.py:901-988","worker.py:1076-1126","index.js:706-748"]}
