{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#feature-scene","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 的功能「打开厨房场景」：选择任务、随机种子、相机和感知模式，启动 RoboCasa 仿真并返回末端位姿与场景信息。通过 robocasa_open 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:892-990","worker.py:264-367"]}
{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#feature-locate","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 的功能「查询物体与夹具」：按名称查找场景对象或厨房夹具，返回世界坐标、尺寸和建议抓取位置；也可用视觉检测返回多个候选。通过 robocasa_locate 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:992-1073","worker.py:639-721"]}
{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#feature-motion","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 的功能「移动机械臂并避障」：输入目标世界坐标和可选姿态，插件用逆运动学驱动手臂，必要时规划绕障路径并尝试恢复。通过 robocasa_move 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1132-1205","worker.py:901-988","planner.py:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#feature-grasp","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 的功能「多角度抓取与投放」：抓取会尝试多个夹爪朝向，并检查物体是否随手臂升起；投放会先移动到目标上方，接近失败时保留夹持。使用 robocasa_grasp 或 robocasa_drop。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1342-1444","worker.py:1076-1204"]}
{"unit_id":"only-one-over__robocasa-control#caveat-local-storage","repo":"only-one-over/robocasa-control","commit":"82651b12bed013eb31feb0514a33fc472761829d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"robocasa-control 使用前须知：插件会把设置、运行记录和截图保存在本机，默认目录为 ~/.dsh/robocasa-control。（见 index.js:21-25、worker.py:264-282）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-25","worker.py:264-282"]}
